  'Perry\'s Carnegie library, built in 1914 after a $12,000 grant in 1912. In 1935 Dr. Charles H. Stowell gave the Stowell-Wiles Art Gallery, a room for paintings by the Perry-born painter Lemuel M. Wiles: 18 at its dedication, 43 now.',
